<h2>Teaching Approach</h2>
<p>My teaching is grounded in the conviction that learning requires active engagement with ideas and the exercise of independent judgment. I maintain rigorous academic expectations while providing the guidance and support necessary for students to develop confidence in their own abilities.</p>
<p>In language instruction, these principles inform Practice-Oriented Second Language Acquisition (PROSLA), a pedagogical approach I have developed that places purposeful communication at the centre of learning. It emphasises structured practice and meaningful opportunities for students to use the target language with increasing independence.</p>


